<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Logical Formatting Tags</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h2>Logical Formatting Tags Example</h2>
    <p><strong>This is important text.</strong></p>
    <p><em>This is emphasized text.</em></p>
    <p><abbr title="HyperText Markup Language">HTML</abbr> is used to create web pages.</p>
    <p><cite>Wings of Fire</cite> is a famous book.</p>
    <p>Java code: <code>System.out.println("Hello");</code></p>
    <p>Press <kbd>Ctrl + C</kbd> to copy.</p>
    <p>Output: <samp>Hello World</samp></p>
    <p>The value of <var>x</var> is 10.</p>
    <p><dfn>HTML</dfn> is the standard markup language for creating web pages.</p>

</body>
</html>
